+    last block) so neither ``inf * 0`` in the forward nor ``0 * inf`` in the backward can
+    produce a NaN. Dead rows only — finite rows are untouched."""
+    v = table[idx].to(dt)
+    return _zero_nonfinite_rows(v) if sanitize else v
